(double quote).  Store the resulting string in newly allocated heap
memory, and push its descriptor @i{c-addr u}.
@*
Compilation @code{( '@i{ccc}"' -- )}: Parse the string @i{ccc}
delimited by a @code{"} (double quote).  Append the run-time
semantics below to the current definition.
@*
Run-time @code{( -- c-addr u )}: Push a descriptor for the
parsed string.

